@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Invoice — status và sagaIntent
state "PENDING / RESERVE" as P
state "READY / NONE" as R
state "PROCESSING / COMMIT" as Processing
state "RECOVERY / RESERVE" as RR
state "RECOVERY / COMMIT" as RC
state "RECOVERY / RELEASE" as RL
state "COMPLETED / NONE" as Done
state "FAILED / NONE" as Failed
state "CANCELLED / NONE" as Cancelled
[*] --> P
P --> R : ready(): RESERVED
P --> RR : defer(RESERVE)
P --> Failed : failedReserve()\nkhông có reservation
RR --> R : reconcile RESERVED
RR --> Failed : definite failure
R --> Processing : startPayment()\none payment
R --> RL : startCancel(): no payment
Processing --> Done : COMMITTED\ncomplete()+outbox
Processing --> RC : defer(COMMIT)
RC --> Done : COMMITTED\ncomplete()
RL --> Cancelled : remote RELEASED; cancelled()
Done --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of RC
RECOVERY giữ nguyên intent khi retry.
attempts>=20: dừng worker, không thêm status mới.
Manual same-key confirm có thể gọi advance lại.
Không transition từ payment sang cancel.
end note
@enduml
